    "detailed_description": "The game is made based on the principle of Tic-Tac-Toe.<br>In order to win, the player needs three consecutive strongholds to form a line.<br>The game is made by UE4. Players can conduct game with computer or other players online.<br><br>[Gameplay]<br>In game,There are 9 strongholds in total.<br>Attacking the stronghold requires all guard AIs to be killed. Otherwise, the attack to stronghold is invalid. <br>Once the stronghold is occupied, the stronghold will be prompted on the UI interface in the upper right corner of the player.<br>When the stronghold UI shows that the strongholds occupied by a certain team of players is three consecutive strongholds in a line,determine the team's victory.",
